@startuml
title GSMTAP encoding and generic UDP delivery
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #475569
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #64748B
top to bottom direction
component "GsmtapMessage<'a>\nsemantic header + borrowed payload" as input
component "Shared header serializer\nGSMTAP v2, 16-byte header" as serializer
component "encode()\nowned Vec<u8>" as vec
component "encode_msgb()\nowned Msgb, direct write\nno intermediate Vec" as msgb
component "into_datagram(destination)\nrequires runtime feature" as datagram
component "Datagram\nMsgb + optional destination" as packet
component "RuntimeContext::try_send_udp\nchecked handle, destination rules\nand backing-byte/message quotas" as admission
component "EnqueueError<Datagram>\noriginal owned value retained" as rejection
component "Generic runtime UDP queue\nlocal kernel send + WriteOutcome" as transport
component "Application-owned peer" as peer
input --> serializer
serializer --> vec
serializer --> msgb
input --> datagram
datagram --> msgb : encode owned bytes
msgb --> packet : via into_datagram
packet --> admission
admission --> rejection : rejected
admission --> transport : admitted ticket
transport --> peer : UDP datagram
note right of packet
Connected socket: destination = None.
Unconnected socket: explicit destination required.
Runtime validates compatibility, not GSMTAP.
end note
note bottom of msgb
Msgb maximum is 65,535 bytes: payload at most 65,519.
UDP wire limits are separate.
end note
note bottom of transport
No protocol branches or dedicated GSMTAP sender in runtime.
Preparation, admission and completion do not prove peer delivery.
No general GSMTAP parser is provided.
end note
@enduml
